    "chunk_text": "\u00fe \u00feon, nim \u00fea smalan cl\u00e6fer wyrt nio\u00feowearde, wyl on ealo\u00fe o\u00f0\u00f0e on beore. Drenc wi\u00fe onfealle, wyl on ealo\u00f0 finuglan, bisceopwirt heahhiolo\u00fee. Drenc wi\u00fe onfealle, wyl on eala\u00f0 spring wyrt o\u00fe\u00fee on beore. Drenc eft wi\u00f0 onfealle, wyl on eala\u00fe cropleac, dweorgedwostlan, wyrmwyrt. Drenc wi\u00fe onfealle, merce, attorla\u00fee, betoce, rude, secg, ontre, clate, bisceopwyrt, gewyrc on Eft wi\u00fe onfealle genim \u00e6t fruman h\u00e6slenne sticcan o\u00fe\u00fee ellenne, writ \u00feinne naman on, asleah \u00fery \u00dea scearpan aslea & \u00fe\u00e6t eall swiginde gedo. Wi\u00f0 onfealle, gefoh fox, asleah of cucum \u00feone tuxl, l\u00e6t hleapan aweg, bind on n\u00e6sce, hafa \u00fee on. Wi\u00fe poc adle, onred, hamwyrt nio\u00feoweard, feldmore ni\u00feeweard, onredes emfela & \u00feara o\u00feerra Drenc wi\u00f0 pocadle, wyl w\u00e6ter on croccan, do hunig, on fleot simle \u00fe\u00e6t fam of o\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t hit nelle ma Ne bi\u00fe sona nan teona. Sealf wi\u00fe pocadle, wyl on buteran singrenan, gearwe, gy\u00ferife, readre netelan crop. Drenc wi\u00fe poccum, bisceopwyrt, attorla\u00fean, springwyrt, clatan nio\u00feewearde, on eala\u00f0 geworht. Wi\u00fe poccum, swi\u00f0e sceal mon blod l\u00e6tan & drincan am",
